          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hi Jeannine, "
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "df29e911ae72"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As per the Ranger "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "process ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://view-su2.highspot.com/viewer/4d77125d4aad6de46175925ca2b27034#1"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", I understand that you have completed the Collibra-certified Solution Architects  and are on the waitlist.  There is an intake for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "date",
              "attrs": {
                "timestamp": "1773532800000",
                "localId": "e4f6e9b4cb90"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ".  Can you please confirm that you are on the wait list?"
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "2d81ba646473"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Also, Becky suggested that you need to watch these, was this part of the Collibra-certified Solution Architects certification (14hours in total)?  "
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "localId": "ff1b62bc3ff9"
          }
